# APP proof for Venus' first WDI slice: all ten human profiles in the existing
# facing gallery, with APP and APP Utilities but without TailorMade.  Venus
# builds the masks in memory from the player's WDI textures; the capture must
# show the basic shirts and blue AB trousers in south/east/north without a
# missing-texture warning. config/app-wdi seeds both APP's opt-in and AB's
# worn-graphic categories; without the latter, a bare pawn is not a pass.
#
# Run after the Pickle lock is free:
#   Run-PickleWsl.ps1 -Mod VenusTouchWaistlines -DepMap wsl-deps.app-wdi.map -Filter '@facings'
